3%80%8C88%E5%91%8A%E5%88%A5%E5%84%AA%E6%83%A0%E3%80%8D%E5%AF%84%E8%AA%9E%E6%8B%9C%E6%8B%9C?mtc=20023</id><title>結業潮｜本地薄餅店The Point Pizza 宣布5月中結業  推出「88告別優惠」寄語拜拜</title><updated>2026-04-03T16:46:00+08:00</updated><content type="html"/><link href="https://ps.hket.com/article/4109929/%E7%B5%90%E6%A5%AD%E6%BD%AE%EF%BD%9C%E6%9C%AC%E5%9C%B0%E8%96%84%E9%A4%85%E5%BA%97The%20Point%20Pizza%20%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%835%E6%9C%88%E4%B8%AD%E7%B5%90%E6%A5%AD%C2%A0%20%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E3%80%8C88%E5%91%8A%E5%88%A5%E5%84%AA%E6%83%A0%E3%80%8D%E5%AF%84%E8%AA%9E%E6%8B%9C%E6%8B%9C?mtc=20023"/><published>2026-04-03T16:46:00+08:00</published></entry><entry><id>https://wealth.hket.com/article/4109624/10%E5%A4%A7%E8%97%8D%E7%B1%8C%E9%AB%98%E6%81%AF%E7%8E%8B%E3%80%806%E5%8E%98%E8%87%B38%E5%8E%98%E8%B2%A1%E6%81%AF%E5%85%BC%E6%94%B6?mtc=20023</id><title>10大藍籌高息王　6厘至8厘財息兼收</title><updated>2026-04-03T17:00:00+08:00</updated><content type="html">

